Oracle Apex Developer Role
Company _ One of the leading MNC in company in India
Location PAN INDIA
Mail at manjeet.kaur@mounttalent.com

Role & responsibilities
Our company is looking for a Oracle APEX Developer to join our team.
Responsibilities:
Maintain assigned systems in accordance with DISA STIGs, NIST standards, and agency requirements;
Document supporting policies, processes and procedures within your areas of responsibilities;
Design and maintain custom Oracle applications using Oracle Apex;
Develop scripts in SQL, PLSQL for data conversion, data migration;
Adherence to policies, processes and procedures within your areas of responsibility;
Perform requirements analysis, development, design, test, and deployment of custom Oracle applications;
Maintain documentation on all work products;
Effective creation of dynamic reports within the Oracle APEX environment, using APEX reporting tools, BI Publisher or Oracle Reports.
Requirements:
5 years of Oracle Apex experience with Version 5.0 or above Required;
5 years of Oracle SQL, PL/SQL experience Required;

Preferred candidate profile


Perks and benefits

